name "Decor Tiles"
category "Pattern"
description "Generates a decor stone tile pattern. Needs an input shape (by default Tile). Returns the cell id in the x component, the depth map in y and the angle of the tiles in degrees in the z component. Use the Split Operator to access the individual components."
